      "side": 1,
      "message": "I read this code as us trying to reduce l to the power \u003e\u003d log2(len(p)).\nPerhaps we can further simplify this into an if and a constant time computation,\ninstead of a for loop:\n\nif diff :\u003d l - len(p); diff \u003e 0 {\n    // Reduce l and power, by the bit difference of the power of 2 closest to len(p).\n    reduction :\u003d 1 + power - uint8(bits.Len32(uint32(len(p))))\n    power -\u003d reduction\n    l \u003e\u003e\u003d reduction\n}\n\nWe could go wilder with that reduction computation but using bits is more legible and perhaps\neven faster than using math.Pow2(.., math.Log2)",
